```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization invitations revoke --help
Revoke an organization invitation

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization invitations revoke [OPTIONS] --yes <ORGANIZATION> <INVITATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <INVITATION>    Exact invitation ID

Options:
      --yes                  Confirm invitation revocation
      --json                 Print the invitation result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
